sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Browser A
  participant R as REST API and ticketRest Lambda
  participant D as Ticket table and DynamoDB Streams
  participant L as ticketSocketHandler
  participant S as API Gateway WebSocket
  actor B as Browser B: owner/Agent, ticket selected
  Note over A,B: Both sign in with Cognito and open WebSocket connections; connect Lambda verifies ID tokens
  rect rgb(225,247,235)
    A->>R: PATCH /tickets/{id}: IN_PROGRESS
    R->>D: Persist status
    D->>L: Stream new and old images
    L->>L: Filter owner/Agents and check JWT expiry
    L->>S: Post ticketChanged metadata to connection
    S-->>B: Update queue and selected status
  end
  rect rgb(237,231,255)
    A->>R: POST /tickets/{id}/comments
    R->>D: Atomic append with verified author
    D->>L: Stream commentAdded
    L->>S: Push metadata: commentsChanged=true
    S-->>B: New-comment notification
    B->>R: GET /tickets/{id}/comments with Cognito token
    R-->>B: Return comments after owner/Agents check
  end
  Note over L,B: WebSocket sends metadata; comment bodies come from the protected API
  Note over A,B: Pause/resume reconnects and resyncs; GraphQL writes use the same stream-to-push path
